399 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 207 0 R
/E (Prior work covers vehicle-routing optimisation, classical assignment, reinforcement learning for routing and dispatch, safe reinforcement learning, and explainable reinforcement learning. These directions are often evaluated separately. SmartRoute AI integrates dynamic assignment, explicit risk, workload balance, baseline comparison, and per-decision explanation. Its contribution remains a proposed integrated design until controlled experiments validate its behaviour.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
