endobj
478 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 212 0 R
/E (Conventional delivery assignment may rely on dispatcher judgement, nearest-partner selection, or optimisation over a fixed snapshot. Manual judgement can incorporate local knowledge but may be inconsistent under high demand. Nearest-partner assignment is inexpensive yet may overlook deadlines, existing workload, and traffic risk. Snapshot optimisation minimises the supplied matrix but does not automatically learn how current decisions affect later states.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
