484 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 212 0 R
/E (SmartRoute AI accepts delivery requests, partner status, traffic estimates, and distance or travel-time information. A state builder combines the inputs. A risk module calculates a normalised score for candidate assignments. The DRL agent selects among feasible actions, while the Hungarian Algorithm and nearest-partner rule provide comparison points. The output layer records the assignment, explanation, and evaluation metrics.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
