535 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 215 0 R
/E (The risk module receives a candidate assignment and returns a normalised score between zero and one. The score aggregates congestion on the expected route, the estimated probability of missing the deadline, excess distance beyond a reference path, and the current workload of the partner. The aggregation weights are configuration parameters and are recorded with every experiment.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
