>>
endobj
537 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 215 0 R
/E (The decision layer contains three interchangeable methods that share the same interface: the DRL policy, the Hungarian Algorithm, and the nearest-partner rule. A common interface ensures that each method receives identical state information and that any difference in outcome is due to the decision logic rather than to the input.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
