/E (3.9.4 Explanation and Metrics Modules)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
539 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 215 0 R
/E (The explanation module compares the selected partner with the feasible alternatives and produces a sentence that states the dominant reasons. The metrics module records delivery time, on-time status, distance, workload, risk, feasibility, and explanation coverage for every completed order and aggregates them by method and scenario.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
