541 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 215 0 R
/E (The simulator is exposed to the learning library through the reset and step operations of a Gym-compatible environment [17]. The reset operation initialises a scenario from a configuration and a seed and returns the first observation. The step operation applies an assignment, advances the simulation, and returns the next observation, the reward, a termination flag, and an information dictionary containing the individual reward components.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
542 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 215 0 R
/E (A thin service layer can wrap the same logic so that a dispatcher interface could request a recommendation for a new order and receive the selected partner, the risk score, and the explanation. The documented prototype uses a web backend for this purpose, but the core framework does not depend on a particular web technology and can be exercised entirely from scripts during experiments.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [13]
>>
