/P 216 0 R
/E (Even a simulation-based project should anticipate the requirements of an operational system. Order and partner records may contain personal information, so any later use of real data must follow the applicable privacy rules, store only the fields that are needed, and restrict access by role. Authentication and session handling must be tested, including failed logins, expired sessions, invalid tokens, and rate limiting.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
546 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 216 0 R
/E (Auditability is supported by immutable decision records. Each record links the decision to the model version and configuration that produced it, which allows a reviewer to reproduce the situation and to determine whether an unusual assignment was caused by the input, the reward weights, or the learned policy.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
