<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 219 0 R
/E (For each assignment, the explanation layer compares the selected partner with feasible alternatives using estimated travel time, risk score, and workload. It can state that the partner was selected because travel time was lower while risk remained acceptable, or because the choice avoided adding work to an already busy partner. The wording must reflect measured feature differences and should not claim that a partner is safest or fastest unless the comparison supports that statement.)
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [9]
>>
