/T (The order module stores order ID, location, arrival time, deadline, priority, and status. The partner module stores partner ID, location, availability, and workload. The traffic module defines time-varying multipliers and travel-time estimates. The risk module normalises risk factors. The assignment module executes the DRL or baseline policy. The explanation module generates a reason from relevant feature comparisons. The logging module records configuration, random seed, action, reward components, outcomes, and explanation.)
/E (The order module stores order ID, location, arrival time, deadline, priority, and status. The partner module stores partner ID, location, availability, and workload. The traffic module defines time-varying multipliers and travel-time estimates. The risk module normalises risk factors. The assignment module executes the DRL or baseline policy. The explanation module generates a reason from relevant feature comparisons. The logging module records configuration, random seed, action, reward components, outcomes, and explanation.)
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
610 0 obj
<<
