/E (The following tests are planned validation activities. Their status must be updated only after the implementation has actually been run. ID Test Expected outcome Status T-01 Order generation Valid locations, deadlines, priority and arrival times Planned T-02 Partner availability Unavailable partners excluded from feasible actions Planned T-03 Risk normalisation Each risk component follows documented scale Planned T-04 No feasible partner Defined no-assignment or deferral outcome Planned T-05 Deadline pressure Urgency affects delay-related reward as configured Planned T-06 Traffic changes Travel time responds to traffic multipliers Planned T-07 Baseline parity Methods receive equivalent scenario information Planned T-08 Assignment validity Selected partner is eligible and available Planned T-09 Explanation generation Each assignment receives a grounded explanation Planned T-10 Reproducibility Same seed/configuration reproduces scenario inputs Planned T-11 Held-out evaluation Test scenarios excluded from policy tuning Planned T-12 Metric aggregation Metrics and run identifiers retained consistently Planned)
/Pg 37 0 R
/K [10]
