/Title (The scenario generator produces reproducible sequences of orders, partner states, and traffic conditions. A scenario is defined by the length of the simulated period, the number of partners, the mean order arrival rate, the spatial distribution of pickup and drop-off points, the distribution of deadline slack, the proportion of priority orders, and the traffic profile. All random draws use a seeded generator so that the same scenario can be repeated for every method.)
/Dest [32 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1687 0 R
